{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n  <body>\n    <p>你是否時常滑手機停不下來，又希望有效提升英文口說能力呢？這款《Practice English, Unlock Apps!》正是為你量身打造的解決方案，它不僅是一款創新的應用鎖定工具，更能將你對社交媒體的依賴轉化為學習英文的動力，幫助你找回專注力，改善口語表達，並重新掌控寶貴的螢幕時間，現在限時免費提供終生版下載。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/460x460bb-75-38.webp\" alt=\"限時免費\">\n    <h2>將滑手機的習慣轉化為學習動力</h2>\n    <p>這款應用程式巧妙地將你最容易分心的應用程式鎖定，直到你完成簡短的英文口說練習。每一次想打開社交媒體或遊戲，都必須先透過實際開口說英文來解鎖，透過每次 1 到 3 分鐘的練習，你可以逐步提升流暢度、發音和自信心，讓無意識的滑動變為有意義的學習過程，養成每日練習英文的好習慣，並顯著減少螢幕時間與分心。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1284x2778bb-59-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1284x2778bb-60-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1284x2778bb-61-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1284x2778bb-62-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1284x2778bb-63-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n    <p>Practice English, Unlock Apps! 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，選 View more Plans 後，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/IMG_3177-473x1024.webp\" alt=\"IMG 3177\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/IMG_3179-473x1024.webp\" alt=\"IMG 3179\">\n    <ul>\n      <li>應用名稱：Practice English, Unlock Apps!</li>\n      <li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n      <li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n    </ul>\n  </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-08T10:48:59.547468+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":503,"images":8,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}